  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, the refractive index of the material of the lens is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>, the refractive index of the medium is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math> and the focal length of the lens in air is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></math>.</p><p>In air:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>In liquid:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>The focal length as measured in air and that as measured inside the liquid medium are related by, </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation (1) implies that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>160</mn><mo> </mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
